# Generic platform wizard widgets (P3-B)

Ship **workspace-neutral composite React widgets** under the `platform.*` namespace so metadata-defined verticals (P3-C builder) render rich fields **without** importing `packages/workspaces/denali/ui`.

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** `TEMP/p3/p3-b-generic-widgets.md` (historical local scratch `p3-b-generic-widgets.md`; not fresh-clone authority — see docs/audits/snapshots/2026-07-31/psr-2b-temp-authority-inventory.yaml) v1.3

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc complete · **implementation complete** (14/14 nanos) · P3-C unblocked

---

## Executive summary

| Metric | v1 target |
|--------|-----------|
| Composite widgets | 3 — `platform.photos`, `platform.location`, `platform.itinerary` |
| Review surface | 1 — `createPlatformReviewSurface()` |
| Theme tokens | optional additive `theme.tokens` on payload |
| Denali parity | **not** 22 widgets — Denali keeps `denali.*` unchanged |
| Namespace | `platform.*` only in builder allowlist (P3-C reuses SDK list) |

---

## Goals

| Goal | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Registry | Central allowlist + renderer map — schema field id → React component |
| Surface factory | `compositeSurfaceId: "platform"` → `createPlatformCompositeSurface()` |
| Resilience | Unknown `compositeId` → **fallback UI** (Denali today returns `null` — P3-B fixes pattern) |
| Publish gate | P3-C rejects ids outside primitives + `platform.*` |
| Denali safety | Zero edits to `packages/workspaces/denali/**` |
| Starter overlay | Metadata verticals on `workspaceType: starter` must resolve platform surface |

## Non-goals (P3-B v1)

- Full Denali composite parity (22 ids in `composite-ids.ts`)
- Super Admin builder UI — P3-C
- Metadata-only plugin without package overlay — P3-D
- New MinIO/storage adapter — reuse manifest `wizardMedia` codegen
- Leaflet map required for location — text/zones editor acceptable v1

---

## Industry alignment (SDUI + form builder)

| Pattern | Source | P3-B mapping |
|---------|--------|--------------|
| **Component registry** | [Pyramid SDUI](https://pyramidui.com/blog/sdui-architecture-patterns) — type string → native renderer; unknown → fallback | `PLATFORM_COMPOSITE_RENDERERS[compositeId]` |
| **Build fallback first** | [MVP Factory SDUI](https://mvpfactory.io/blog/server-driven-ui-for-mobile-apps-json-schema-contracts-component-registries-and/) | `PlatformCompositeFallback` before real widgets ship |
| **Schema-first contract** | [Sujeet Jaiswal — Form Builder](https://sujeet.pro/articles/design-form-builder) — registry + renderer layering | `fieldRegistry` (schema) ≠ React (registry) |
| **Stable keys** | SDUI 2026 — reconciler preserves field state | `field.fieldId` + `wizardFieldPathAttributes` |
| **Versioned allowlist** | OpenDecree / schema registries — publish validates ids | `PLATFORM_GENERIC_RENDERER_IDS` in SDK |

---

## Two-axis model (do not collapse)

| Axis | Source | Example | Resolves via |
|------|--------|---------|--------------|
| **A — Renderer id** | `fieldRegistry.fields[].id` | `platform.photos` | `resolvePlatformCompositeRenderer(compositeId)` |
| **B — Surface factory id** | `wizardHost.compositeSurfaceId` | `"platform"` | `resolveWizardCompositeSurface("platform")` |

Both must align for composites to mount. Today starter uses `createPlatformWizardHostHooks` **without** `compositeSurfaceId` — composites silently skip in `wizard-field.tsx:247-257` when surface is null.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  FR[fieldRegistry.fields id] --> RP[buildRenderPlan]
  RP --> WF[WizardField uiHints.compositeId]
  WH[wizardHost.compositeSurfaceId] --> RS[resolveWizardCompositeSurface]
  WF --> RS
  RS --> SF[surface.renderCompositeField]
  SF --> MAP[PLATFORM_COMPOSITE_RENDERERS]
  MAP -->|known| UI[React widget]
  MAP -->|unknown| FB[PlatformCompositeFallback]
```

Headless plan authority: `packages/platform-core/src/engine/render-plan.ts` → `buildFieldUiHints` sets `compositeId: entry.id` when `kind === "composite"` or `id !== canonicalPath` (lines 99–110).

---

## Denali vs platform (scope boundary)

| | Denali (unchanged) | Platform (P3-B) |
|--|-------------------|-------------------|
| Composite count | 22 (`DENALI_IMPLEMENTED_COMPOSITE_IDS`) | 3 + review |
| Id prefix | `denali.*` | `platform.*` |
| React location | `packages/workspaces/denali/src/ui/` | `apps/web/src/wizard/platform/` |
| Surface factory | `compositeSurfaceId: "denali"` | `compositeSurfaceId: "platform"` |
| Unknown renderer | `resolveDenaliCompositeRenderer` → **null** (blank) | **Fallback** with `data-composite-fallback` |
| Draft type | `DenaliTourWizardDraft` | `TourWizardDraft` + `tour-wizard-draft-path` helpers |

**Gap P3-B closes:** Denali `DenaliCompositeField` returns null for unknown ids — platform tree must never silently blank.

