## Media upload pipeline

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant W as platform-photos-field
  participant BFF as /api/wizard-media/{key}
  participant API as apps/api proxy
  participant S as MinIO (existing)

  W->>W: resolveWizardMediaBffPath(mediaRouteKey)
  W->>BFF: multipart upload (wizardSessionId)
  BFF->>API: forward with tenant context
  API->>S: putDraftPhoto (manifest export)
  S-->>W: objectKey → canonical photos[]
```

| Item | v1 decision |
|------|-------------|
| Route key | `"platform-photos"` — neutral BFF `/api/wizard-media/platform-photos` |
| Session gate | Upload enabled only when `wizardSessionId` defined (Denali pattern) |
| Max bytes | Read from env/manifest export — do not import Denali constants |
| Denali route | `wizard-photos` → `/api/tours/wizard-photos` unchanged |

Implement upload client under `apps/web/src/wizard/platform/` — **reimplement** Denali `photo-upload-client` logic using generic fetch, no `@app-tour/workspace-denali/ui` import.

---

## Widget contracts

All composites use `TourWizardDraft` + `@/tours/tour-wizard-draft-path` (`getCanonicalValue`, `setCanonicalValue`, `getCanonicalStringValue`).

Props surface: `WizardCompositeFieldRenderProps` from `apps/web/src/wizard/wizard-surface-types.ts`.

### `platform.photos`

| Item | Contract |
|------|----------|
| Default canonical path | `photos` |
| Shape | `{ id: string; objectKey?: string; url?: string; caption?: string; dayIndex?: number }[]` |
| Markers | `data-platform-photos-field`, `data-photos-upload-disabled` when no session |
| Multi-day | Optional `dayIndex` select — simplified vs Denali (no tour-kind inference required v1) |
| Reference (read-only) | `denali-photos-field.tsx` — reimplement with ui-primitives |

### `platform.location`

| Item | Contract |
|------|----------|
| Canonical path | field-specific from `RenderFieldPlan.canonicalPath` |
| Shape v1 | `{ zones?: Array<{ id: string; label: string; lat?: number; lng?: number }>; address?: string }` |
| Map UI | Optional Leaflet dynamic import — **text/zones list acceptable v1** |
| Marker | `data-platform-location-field` |

### `platform.itinerary`

| Item | Contract |
|------|----------|
| Canonical path | e.g. `itinerary.days` or registry-defined |
| Shape v1 | `{ days: Array<{ dayIndex: number; title?: string; segments?: Array<{ destination?: string; notes?: string }> }> }` |
| Scope | Segment list editor — no per-segment photo picker (P3-D) |
| Marker | `data-platform-itinerary-field` |

### `platform.review` (review surface)

Register `createPlatformReviewSurface()`:

| Method | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| `renderValidationSummary` | List `ValidationIssue[]` with step focus callback |
| `renderReviewChrome` | Optional read-only field summary from render plan labels |
| `computeCompletionHeader` | **omit** Denali-specific completion headers v1 |

Wire `REVIEW_SURFACES["platform"]` in codegen. Starter already sets `validationSurfaceId: "platform"` in hooks — review surface must exist or validation step degrades.

---

## Theme tokens (optional payload — N-013)

Additive block on `WorkspaceDefinitionPayload`:

```typescript
theme?: {
  readonly tokens?: Readonly<Record<string, string>>;
};
```

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Keys | Semantic only: `--ws-primary`, `--ws-accent`, `--ws-surface` |
| Forbidden | Raw `#hex` without semantic key — rejected by headless validator |
| Headless | `packages/platform-core/src/theme/resolve-workspace-theme-tokens.ts` |
| Web apply | `platform-theme-tokens.ts` — `data-workspace-theme="platform"` + inline CSS vars |
| Merge | `metadata-plugin-adapter.ts` spreads into plugin when present |

