| Tree | Rule |
|------|------|
| `apps/web/src/wizard/platform/**` | ✅ platform widgets live here |
| `apps/web/src/platform/**` | ❌ P3-C Super Admin — no widget code |
| `packages/workspaces/denali/**` | ❌ zero diff entire P3-B EPIC |
| `packages/platform-core` | headless only — no React |
| `packages/workspace-sdk/metadata` | allowlist + optional theme types |

**New spec:** `apps/web/test/platform-epic-b-boundary.spec.ts` — no `denali/ui` or `@app-tour/workspace-denali/ui` under `src/wizard/platform/`.

Existing `platform-epic-c-boundary.spec.ts` covers `src/platform/` — keep both.

